@startuml CU-12
actor "Admin / Manager" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (sucursal/inventario)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /inventory" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» InventoryService / inventory, movement" as Model

Adm -> UI : 1: elegir sucursal
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /inventory?branch_id=X
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list(db, branch_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: stock por variante
Ctrl --> UI : 5: InventoryRead[]
UI --> Adm : 6: tabla de stock

Adm -> UI : 7: ajuste +/- unidad
UI -> Ctrl : 8: PATCH /inventory/{b}/{v}/adjust
Ctrl -> Model : 9: adjust(db, …, quantity, reason)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: inventario + movimiento
Ctrl --> UI : 11: InventoryRead
UI --> Adm : 12: disponibilidad actualizada

Adm -> UI : 13: historial
UI -> Ctrl : 14: GET /inventory/movements
Ctrl -> Model : 15: list_movements(db, …)
Model --> Ctrl : 16: movimientos IN/OUT
Ctrl --> UI : 17: InventoryMovementRead[]
UI --> Adm : 18: auditoría

@enduml